NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY CODE

This project contains no copied third-party source. The test oracles are
external programs run as subprocesses and are not linked into any build:

  * ADFlib (https://github.com/adflib/ADFlib) -- library LGPL-2.1,
    command-line tools GPL-2.0-or-later. Pinned per tests/fixtures/fixtures.lock.
  * amitools (https://github.com/cnvogelg/amitools) -- GPL-3.0. Pinned per
    tests/fixtures/fixtures.lock.

The ADFlib test images under tests/data/ carry no separate licence from
upstream and are downloaded at test time; they are never committed or
redistributed by this project.